# A GeneralPolygon nverts element beyond RtInt's range.
# GMANRIBParse::TokenVector::toRtIntVector must reject 4294967297 with
# RIE_RANGE. GeneralPolygon, unlike PointsPolygons, carries no sum check
# at its own dispatch, so a truncated count here would become an
# out-of-bounds read rather than a caught mismatch.
#
# A trailing Sphere follows AGENTS.md's "RIB authoring" section, "The
# desync convention."
Display "malformed_out.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 200 200 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [45]
Clipping 0.5 50
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
GeneralPolygon [4294967297] "P" [-1 -1 0  1 -1 0  1 1 0]
Sphere 0.5 -0.5 0.5 360
WorldEnd
